WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.709
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Hannah works for the BBC.

00:00:03.024 --> 00:00:06.506
She has a son Kit who’s three years old.

00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:10.451
Hannah, what time do you usually get up?

00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:18.062
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> I get up at 7.00. But I also get up in the night, because Kit usually calls me.

00:00:22.963 --> 00:00:35.678
I tell him to sleep, but he usually comes into my bed.

00:00:36.052 --> 00:00:38.083
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you usually feel tired?

00:00:38.215 --> 00:00:41.349
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes, I always feel tired!

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:44.621
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have a shower or a bath in the morning?

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:50.762
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> I turn on the TV for Kit and then I have a bath in five minutes.

00:00:51.119 --> 00:00:52.905
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you always have breakfast?

00:00:52.939 --> 00:00:55.840
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes, I need breakfast every day!

00:00:56.649 --> 00:00:57.972
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where do you have it?

00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:01.092
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> I have it in a café on the way to work.

00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:03.315
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you have for breakfast?

00:01:03.524 --> 00:01:08.876
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> I have a coffee and sometimes I have some toast with avocado.

00:01:09.038 --> 00:01:10.319
It’s delicious.

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:12.548
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you go to work?

00:01:12.909 --> 00:01:16.485
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> The perfect time to leave the house is at 8.00,

00:01:16.841 --> 00:01:20.089
but we usually leave at twenty past eight.

00:01:20.649 --> 00:01:23.403
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you usually need to hurry in the morning?

00:01:23.447 --> 00:01:24.905
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes, always!

00:01:25.212 --> 00:01:26.697
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you like mornings?

00:01:26.722 --> 00:01:28.897
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes. I love mornings.

00:01:29.046 --> 00:01:29.792
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Why?

00:01:30.057 --> 00:01:34.772
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Because I love my job, and I’m happy to go to work!